DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
22140::$$$message_0173_0000_0000$$$::The sky is clear.[lr]::
22141::$$$message_0173_0000_0001$$$::The strong sunlight is numbing my sense of seasons.[lr]::
22142::$$$message_0173_0000_0002$$$::The sea breeze brushing my cheeks feels good, and the cries of the black-tailed gulls are mitigating my sadness.::
22143::$$$message_0173_0001_0000$$$::A perfect location that brings no complaints.[lr]::
22144::$$$message_0173_0001_0001$$$::Fuyuki's port that would seem to be favored by a father with his family or by lovers. However...[lr]::
22145::$$$message_0173_0001_0002$$$::Because of this man who looks like he's involved with the gang, it has turned into a demonic realm that people can't go near...!::
22146::$$$message_0173_0002_0000$$$::"But there's actually nothing strange about it."[lr]::
22147::$$$message_0173_0002_0001$$$::He's integrating so well that it's scary.[lr]::
22148::$$$message_0173_0002_0002$$$::They say that the mental state of a swordsman is one with nature, but that is certainly the realm of an expert.[lr]::
22149::$$$message_0173_0002_0003$$$::To pay respect to that splendor, I buy a can of coffee from the vending machine.::
22150::$$$message_0173_0003_0000$$$::"Hey, are you catching any fish?"[lr]::
22151::$$$message_0173_0003_0001$$$::"Yeah, here and there. I've got a mountain of mackerel, four black seabream, and three filefish."[lr]::
22152::$$$message_0173_0003_0002$$$::"Damn. Man, you have no principles. Are you able to fish that many at the port?"[lr]::
22153::$$$message_0173_0003_0003$$$::"It is the ocean. Obviously there's a lot of variety.[lr]::
22154::$$$message_0173_0003_0004$$$::Well, there's still too many different things mixed in, but isn't it fine since they're rare?"::
22155::$$$message_0173_0004_0000$$$::So arbitrary.[lr]::
22156::$$$message_0173_0004_0001$$$::I pass him the canned coffee and peek into the bucket.[lr]::
22157::$$$message_0173_0004_0002$$$::The caught fish have more variation than Lancer's statement.::
22158::$$$message_0173_0005_0000$$$::"You have a lot of mackerel."[lr]::
22159::$$$message_0173_0005_0001$$$::"I don't know why, but they were biting at every cast. Oh yeah, I was able to catch an octopus until recently."[lr]::
22160::$$$message_0173_0005_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Is that rod a magical rod?[font italic=false][lr]::
22161::$$$message_0173_0005_0003$$$::With this amount, this man will be able to conquer all the sushi toppings... [font italic=true]Huh?[font italic=false][lr]::
22162::$$$message_0173_0005_0004$$$::There appears to be something crucial missing when looking closely.::
22163::$$$message_0173_0006_0000$$$::"Lancer, you've been fishing here all day, right? Do you not have a rod holder?"[lr]::
22164::$$$message_0173_0006_0001$$$::A rod holder is something that holds the fishing rod still and is an item that is essential for a long fishing session.[lr]::
22165::$$$message_0173_0006_0002$$$::Fishing rods are pretty heavy, and targeted prey can escape from slight movements.[lr]::
22166::$$$message_0173_0006_0003$$$::If you're fishing with a rod for over half a day, a rod holder is a necessity.::
22167::$$$message_0173_0007_0000$$$::"Oh, that would be convenient to have, but I don't need one. It's fun to watch the ocean with a rod and a line.[lr]::
22168::$$$message_0173_0007_0001$$$::Well, it's more fun if the hit is bigger."[lr]::
22169::$$$message_0173_0007_0002$$$::Even while complaining, his fishing rod doesn't waver.[lr]::
22170::$$$message_0173_0007_0003$$$::Lo and behold Lancer's arms.[lr]::
22171::$$$message_0173_0007_0004$$$::Not just his power, but it's his machine-like accuracy and stamina too.::
22172::$$$message_0173_0008_0000$$$::"Come to think of it, that's true. There's no way that you would rely on modern tools. Did you pick up that rod somewhere?"::
22173::$$$message_0173_0009_0000$$$::"Yeah, there was this nice guy![lr]::
22174::$$$message_0173_0009_0001$$$::I spent a day fixing his bent back, so he gave it to me to thank me. For some reason, I didn't see him anymore from the next day onward though!"[lr]::
22175::$$$message_0173_0009_0002$$$::He laughs out loud.[lr]::
22176::$$$message_0173_0009_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
22177::$$$message_0173_0009_0004$$$::Master Lancer, that's close to threatening.::
22178::$$$message_0173_0010_0000$$$::"Well, it was Matou's older brother."[lr]::
22179::$$$message_0173_0010_0001$$$::"It was Shinji!?"[lr]::
22180::$$$message_0173_0010_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Geez, no wonder he always seems lonely sitting at the edge of the port...[font italic=false]::
22181::$$$message_0173_0011_0000$$$::"...Hm. And you're using it to its fullest extent because you received it? So that's why you're spending every day fishing, huh?[lr]::
22182::$$$message_0173_0011_0001$$$::...Well, it makes me relieved that you're behaving. Is fishing that fun?"::
22183::$$$message_0173_0012_0000$$$::"It's like training that comes along with fun.[lr]::
22184::$$$message_0173_0012_0001$$$::I have some confidence in this. I take pride in being the strongest among all Servants when it comes to fishing.[lr]::
22185::$$$message_0173_0012_0002$$$::The Greek great heroes aside, it's a man's world where some copycat idiot or poor prince that doesn't even have a rod can't join."::
22186::$$$message_0173_0013_0000$$$::[font italic=true]Oh.[font italic=false][lr]::
22187::$$$message_0173_0013_0001$$$::A crack forms.[lr]::
22188::$$$message_0173_0013_0002$$$::I feel a sign of a storm just at the port.::
22189::$$$message_0173_0014_0000$$$::"Are you sure it's okay for you to say that? Words are the source of disaster, Lancer."[lr]::
22190::$$$message_0173_0014_0001$$$::"Hm? Does it mean that gossip has its consequences? That won't spread if you don't go around talking about it.[lr]::
22191::$$$message_0173_0014_0002$$$::Well, there's nothing to be done about it even if it does spread. I'll accept the challenge if people want to kill each other."::
22192::$$$message_0173_0015_0000$$$::So Lancer has no intention to start a fight, but he'll accept if he's challenged.[lr]::
22193::$$$message_0173_0015_0001$$$::Lancer reels in a hit.[lr]::
22194::$$$message_0173_0015_0002$$$::"A mackerel."[lr]::
22195::$$$message_0173_0015_0003$$$::"A mackerel it is."[lr]::
22196::$$$message_0173_0015_0004$$$::Looks like he's not pleased with the fish he caught, [se volume=70 storage=se552.wav]as Lancer removes the fish hook and returns it to the ocean.::
22197::$$$message_0173_0016_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
22198::$$$message_0173_0016_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
22199::$$$message_0173_0016_0002$$$::The conversation stops.[lr]::
22200::$$$message_0173_0016_0003$$$::There's nothing more awkward than a fishing spot with nothing to talk about.::
22201::$$$message_0173_0017_0000$$$::"Sorry for interrupting. Keep on fishing mackerel."[lr]::
22202::$$$message_0173_0017_0001$$$::"Yeah. Thanks for the drink."::
22203::$$$message_0173_0018_0000$$$::l leave the port.[lr]::
22204::$$$message_0173_0018_0001$$$::You don't know how people are until you talk to them.[lr]::
22205::$$$message_0173_0018_0002$$$::The port is extremely boring for me, but it seems to be Lancer's favorite spot.[lr]::
22206::$$$message_0173_0018_0003$$$::A bright port that could be mistaken as a summer day.[lr]::
22207::$$$message_0173_0018_0004$$$::Hopefully, this peace won't be disturbed by heartless intruders.::

